 "remarks": "Welcome to an exceptional North Stamford estate set on 2 private, landscaped acres. Convenient commuter location, near Long Ridge shops and entrance/exit to Merritt Pkwy. This custom contemporary ranch offers approx. 6,975 sq. ft. above grade plus approx. 2,100 sq. ft. of finished lower-level and bonus space. With 7 bedrooms (4 en-suite), 6 full and 2 half baths, the layout is ideal for multigenerational living, with two separate wings and separate entrances for in-laws, an au pair or long-staying guests. Soaring vaulted ceilings, 9 ft.+ ceilings throughout, a first-floor en-suite and an oversized kitchen create a home that is impressive and functional. The grand family room and multiple formal and informal living areas offer flexibility for everyday living, working from home and entertaining. A driveway leads to the fully walkout lower level with its own private entrance, ready for a home theater, gym or whatever you envision. An expansive raised stone patio and fire pit extend the living space outdoors. All within convenient reach of downtown Stamford, schools, shopping and commuter routes. A rare opportunity to own a home that can adapt to your needs today and for generations to come. Home is vacant and photos are virtually staged.",
